This starter uses **SvelteKit** with **mdsvex** so you can mix markdown and Svelte.

## First steps

1. Copy this project.
2. Create new `.svx` files in `src/posts/en` or `src/posts/pt`.
3. Open the blog route and verify your content appears.

You can also embed dynamic UI in your post content when needed.
